    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You're accustomed to the desolate wilds of Belkzen and able to blend into the sparse shadows of craggy rocks and quench your thirst with drops of water. You might be a member of an isolated orc hold, traveling mercenary, or wandering warrior from nearby human settlements."
